flowchart TB
  subgraph Roles[三角色工作台]
    Admin[管理员\n权限·门店·模板·审计]
    Ops[运营\n总览·排行·收件箱·日历]
    Store[店长\n日报·建议·复盘·微信复制]
  end
  subgraph App[ONEIRA 运营中台]
    UI[React + TypeScript + Framer Motion]
    API[tRPC + Express\n服务端权限校验]
  end
  subgraph Data[持久化数据]
    Users[(用户与角色)]
    Stores[(门店目录)]
    Reports[(日报与自定义指标)]
    Collab[(协作·回复·复盘·日历)]
    Audit[(审计日志)]
  end
  Admin --> UI
  Ops --> UI
  Store --> UI
  UI --> API
  API --> Users
  API --> Stores
  API --> Reports
  API --> Collab
  API --> Audit
  Reports --> Summary[日期汇总与门店排行]
  Summary --> Ops
